.el .ds Aq '
.TH nut 1  "nut-cli 0.1.0" nut
.SH NAME
nut \- Manage and verify NUT UPS protection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBnut\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A read\-first management CLI for Network UPS Tools. NUT\*(Aqs daemons remain the only part of the outage shutdown path.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Color output policy
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto: Color when writing to a terminal (default)
.IP \(bu 2
always: Color even when piped
.IP \(bu 2
never: Never color
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\fR
Use ASCII symbols and bars
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON where supported
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Include additional diagnostic detail
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read host settings from this file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
nut\-status(1)
Show UPS status
.TP
nut\-battery(1)
Show battery charge and runtime, or run a guarded self\-test
.TP
nut\-events(1)
Show UPS event history
.TP
nut\-beeper(1)
Show or change the UPS beeper
.TP
nut\-notify(1)
Send or inspect UPS notifications
.TP
nut\-init(1)
Plan or apply NUT configuration
.TP
nut\-rollback(1)
List or restore a configuration backup
.TP
nut\-config(1)
Inspect, scaffold, render, or diff host settings
.TP
nut\-bios(1)
Guide and verify BIOS recovery settings
.TP
nut\-doctor(1)
Check UPS protection and recovery readiness
.TP
nut\-drill(1)
Guide and record a physical outage drill
.TP
nut\-completion(1)
Install, inspect, or remove shell completion
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
